{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hana.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "给发视频的账号发一条私信",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hana.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hana.second",
    "idolId": "hana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "三天后，私信有了回复。对方问，可以通个电话吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "hana_friend",
        "text": "您好，突然联系不好意思。……请问，是事务所的人吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是的。冒昧问一句，那个视频是您拍的吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "hana_friend",
        "text": "是我拍的。好几个月的份，剪成了三十秒。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "hana_friend",
        "text": "……其实，已经有好几家发过私信来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "hana_friend",
        "text": "私信写得随随便便的，搜也搜不到事务所的，一看就不靠谱，直接排除了。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "hana_friend",
        "text": "我挑下来觉得可以的，是这里。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "hana_friend",
        "text": "────２８３プロ。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……为什么是我们？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "hana_friend",
        "text": "因为查得到。而且私信写得很认真。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hana_friend",
        "text": "……还有，我觉得羽那是该站上大舞台的人。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "text": "她把电话交给了本人。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，没关系的。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……不过，真的是真人啊──！",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……是的。只靠电话和邮件，确实很难让人相信吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──那么，我重新问一次。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对偶像这个职业，您有兴趣吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然，还有高中生活。我知道现在做不到。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以，我想等到您高中毕业。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……等我？居然愿意做到那个地步啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是的。……我就是这么希望您能成为偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "诶──？　……呵呵。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "──偶像，我觉得挺好的。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "不过，我可以先好好跟家里商量一下吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然……！请慢慢考虑。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "需要的话，我随时都可以再过去一趟。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "嗯！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "text": "电话挂了。那一天之后，消息断了一阵子。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "text": "再收到她的信，是毕业典礼之后的事。"
      }
    }
  },
